"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":117966114,"text":"軽やかな足取りに、力もありそうだ。普段から鍛えてるんだろ？","nextNodeIds":[751880203]},{"nodeId":751880203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":3481928290,"text":"お前、「豊穣の邦」の勇士か？それとも別の部族の出身か？","nextNodeIds":[751880204,751880205]},{"nodeId":751880204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2076299458,"text":"通りすがりの冒険者だよ。","nextNodeIds":[751880206]},{"nodeId":751880206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":3583016842,"text":"そうか、残念だ。まぁそうだよな、ちょうど人手が足りねぇって時に助っ人が現れるなんて、そんな都合のいい話あるわけねぇよな。","nextNodeIds":[751880207]},{"nodeId":751880207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1364383218,"text":"どうしたの？","nextNodeIds":[751880208]},{"nodeId":751880208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":246159818,"text":"見ての通り、ここに農場があるだろ？","nextNodeIds":[751880209]},{"nodeId":751880209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":1555030482,"text":"長らく一人で管理してきたんだが、最近ちょっとツイてなくてな…","nextNodeIds":[751880210]},{"nodeId":751880210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":414107866,"text":"数日前、部族の勇士とレスリングをして、背中を痛めちまったんだ…わかってる、バカなことしたよ。","nextNodeIds":[751880211]},{"nodeId":751880211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":91335778,"text":"親父の新しい畑を手伝うどころか、自分の農場の世話すらできねぇ始末で…はぁ、正直歩くのもキツいくらいだ。","nextNodeIds":[751880212]},{"nodeId":751880212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":617590866,"text":"で、数日だけでも手伝ってくれそうなヤツがいねえかと考えてた時に、ちょうどお前が現れた。","nextNodeIds":[751880213]},{"nodeId":751880213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":2761637114,"text":"だが、お前は通りすがりの冒険者だ。畑仕事は毎日やらねぇといけねぇし、今日だけ乗り切ったところでどのみち荒れちまう。","nextNodeIds":[751880214]},{"nodeId":751880214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":4294349250,"text":"まぁ、今のオレじゃ部族のとこまで行くこともできねぇから、どのみち飼ってるライノ竜たちしか頼れねぇけどな。","nextNodeIds":[751880215]},{"nodeId":751880215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":2613554026,"text":"それなのに…はぁ、いたずら好きで反抗的な奴らでな。三匹とも畑に居座ったまま、全然オレのとこに戻ってこねぇんだ。","nextNodeIds":[751880216]},{"nodeId":751880216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":312180586,"text":"だから、ちょっと頼まれてくれねぇか？こんな状態でろくに歩けもしねぇから、オレの代わりにアイツらを連れ戻してきてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[751880217]},{"nodeId":751880217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3195466258,"text":"いいよ。","nextNodeIds":[751880218]},{"nodeId":751880218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":2611202978,"text":"助かる。アイツら、いつもならもう少し言うことを聞くし、なんだかんだ畑も手伝ってくれるんだが、ここ最近は様子が変でな…","nextNodeIds":[751880219]},{"nodeId":751880219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6430,"speakerName":"パカリン","textMapHash":2475607930,"text":"だがまぁ、お前がちょっと声をかけりゃ、三匹とも素直に戻ってくるだろ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":751880205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2359663298,"text":"ナタ人じゃないよ。","nextNodeIds":[751880206]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7518802,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133517034"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["6430"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7518803,"order":2